# Optional: a GitHub personal access token (read-only, "public_repo" scope).
# Raises the GitHub API rate limit from 60 to 5,000 requests/hour and allows
# private repos. When set, the app pre-fills it so you don't type it each time.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and paste your token below.
# NOTE: VITE_ vars are bundled into the browser build — only use this locally,
# never deploy the app publicly with a real token here.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
